			"x": 2280,
			"y": 1840,
			"width": 1047,
			"height": 1240,
			"label": "fully"
		},
		{
			"id": "e9b9d37a7efcd0c1",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 5880,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 785,
			"height": 517,
			"label": "Non blocking cache"
		},
		{
			"id": "4c8da83fb4b34903",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/09-Direct-map.png",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 409,
			"width": 550,
			"height": 349
		},
		{
			"id": "08b2132a4e7c2e6b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/03-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": -200,
			"y": -160,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "b2833fa172c7034d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Compulsory misses(cold-start misses) 開機的時候 cache 都會 miss，每一次 memory block 都只會發生一次。\n- Capacity misses 是指 Cache block 個數不足已，容納一個 process，那麼就會一直被釋放又被拉回記憶體，==只有 fully 會有這個問題==。\n- Conflict misses(collision misses) ==只有在 Set 和 Direct 才會，fully 不會==，因為會一直競爭某些 block。",
			"x": 300,
			"y": -188,
			"width": 580,
			"height": 184,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "b10fdc05444d2d58",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/15-Direct-map.png",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 895,
			"width": 519,
			"height": 306
		},
		{
			"id": "b970dba42c12910f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "那麼使用 LRU 替換法則，所以把 0 號換掉",
			"x": 1794,
			"y": 205,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "a0fd88f4cb16bcbd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "那麼接下來又換 0 上去但是 LRU，1 Long time not use，所以就會把 1 換掉變成 0 號要上去的，那麼這邊就是 Capacity Miss，容量不足。",
			"x": 1794,
			"y": 506,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 145,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "0ac89392e9dd1b39",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/01-容量比關聯度很重要.png",
			"x": 2280,
			"y": -216,
			"width": 590,
			"height": 313
		},
		{
			"id": "4df33bd129f69cff",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 預抓技術在 Miss 的時候直接那下一個或是指定跳幾號，例如拿 0 會順便把 1 也放上去。",
			"x": 1788,
			"y": 918,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 117,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "5ab62a56f3aeaf54",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/19-Direct-map.png",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 1295,
			"width": 505,
			"height": 287
		},
		{
			"id": "322ebb9f4f2c5ab0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/22-fully.png",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 1860,
			"width": 487,
			"height": 331
		},
		{
			"id": "97fa61ad271c4453",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "往上找 block size 4 個看有沒有一樣的沒有一樣的就是 MIss，如果往上找一樣的那就是不算一次，也就是說往上找的途中中間有一樣的數字他只算一次。",
			"x": 2966,
			"y": 1978,
			"width": 341,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "394ab5f603e3c2a4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 容量比關聯度很重要",
			"x": 2450,
			"y": 160,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "91b36a03a425e2d6",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/08-Set - 方法大致與 Direct Map 相同。.png",
			"x": 3520,
			"y": 404,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 304
		},
		{
			"id": "391f36b2bd31d067",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 方法大致與 Direct Map 相同。",
			"x": 4190,
			"y": 521,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 50
		},
		{
			"id": "e51278ad4717aee2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/13-Set - 使用 LRU 替換.png",
			"x": 3520,
			"y": 787,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 288
		},
		{
			"id": "60e6d53694cdc3d1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "使用 LRU 替換",
			"x": 4270,
			"y": 886,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60
		},
		{
			"id": "7f9a2a880c6b8b97",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/07-Non blocking cache.png",
			"x": 5900,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 745,
			"height": 267
		},
		{
			"id": "c03069ebe62184ee",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- super pipeline，就是 out-of-order processors 隱藏 miss latency。\n- hit under miss，Hit 用前面指令的 hit time 隱藏 miss 的時間\n- miss under miss，就是把兩個 miss 疊在一起可以減少 miss 逞罰的時間。",
			"x": 5954,
			"y": 723,
			"width": 638,
			"height": 94,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "8c861b20ca84d97c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Direct 可以由下往上看（比較快），但是 set 和 fully 只能由上往下看。\n- direct 那麼就是可以看 index 由下往上看對應的 cache。",
			"x": 2958,
			"y": 988,
			"width": 333,
			"height": 121,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "5e524cc337aeda4f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 那麼找到 WA 了那要記得我前數到 4 的倍數",
			"x": 2958,
			"y": 1409,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "5042c1e51a875b4e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/18-Set.png",
			"x": 3520,
			"y": 1175,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 283
		},
		{
			"id": "27ab1a303d931caa",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/20-Set.png",
			"x": 4120,
			"y": 1500,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "3f236d02c7720f51",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 簡單來說就是使用 LRU 替換，那麼就是先看 Index 然後就是使用 LRU 來替換可能已經有的內容，往上找第二個不一樣的，且是 2 的倍數了所以直接放。",
			"x": 4170,
			"y": 1262,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 147,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "66b0c80dddbad76e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/21-Set.png",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 1500,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 223
		},
		{
			"id": "bda05520fcffe3b7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 是找 Tag 不一樣且 Block 0，且在 block 裡面就算是 hit 也要計算一次",
			"x": 5100,
			"y": 1572,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 68,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "5c2d09bad499ef9c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/23-fully.png",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 2340,
			"width": 486,
			"height": 331
		},
		{
			"id": "e5b1fe91fc9c04a3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "看 BA 一樣的上往下看如果一樣就是 capt 如果第一次出現就是 cp",
			"x": 3005,
			"y": 2462,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
