			"x": 1240,
			"y": 840,
			"width": 411,
			"height": 218
		},
		{
			"id": "0e53444c30e03912",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "往上找四個",
			"x": 3005,
			"y": 2880,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ddcfa5ef619bf90b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "假設我們 0,4 都使用過了那麼第一次他們都會 Compulsory Miss",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 190,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ba5a8a7f82d233d6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "那麼又發生了一次那這次就是 Conflict Miss",
			"x": 930,
			"y": 591,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "5b770cad3219bbbd",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/12-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": 390,
			"y": 496,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 249
		},
		{
			"id": "81f64062f3bcefc4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/04-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": 390,
			"y": 116,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 232
		},
		{
			"id": "24ad202b5c59ce5f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/11-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": -318,
			"y": 457,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 204
		},
		{
			"id": "c164d8b0b35fb1f7",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/06-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": -304,
			"y": 173,
			"width": 586,
			"height": 176
		},
		{
			"id": "608515471f6f9d7b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. capacity misses 就是增加 cache size 但是會對 performance 降低不太好。\n2. Conflict misses 增加關聯度，但是也會增加 CPU 存取的時間。\n3. Compulsory misses 增加 block size，但會造成 miss rate 上升。",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 745,
			"width": 364,
			"height": 184,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "d3d18e172cf4944b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/17-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": 340,
			"y": 1059,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 217
		},
		{
			"id": "e527a09996d4968b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model/16-計算機組織_TOPIC_13_3C Model.png",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 1058,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 218
		},
		{
			"id": "c5ba2471fea4f6a6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 如果 Index 都一樣前一個（最最靠近）那麼在比較 Tag 如果一樣就是 Hit，否則就是 Miss\n- 然後每種 Cache 只有兩種，就是判斷是不是 Compulsory 如果不是就是另一種，那麼就是看 memory block address，就是就是往上看看他有沒有出現沒有就是 Compulsory miss",
			"x": 2940,
			"y": 493,
			"width": 427,
			"height": 181,
			"color": "1"
		}
	],
